  r:"Living in space is very different from living on Earth. Without gravity, water does not pour, so astronauts drink from bags with straws. Their food is in packets, and they must be careful that crumbs do not float into the machines. Their muscles and bones become weaker in space, so they must exercise for two hours every day. Saudi astronauts have visited the space station too, and they did science experiments that could help people on Earth.",
