  c:[["Which is faster, a train or a bicycle?","A train is much faster than a bicycle.","A train is much hungrier than a bicycle.","Faster is train bicycle."],["Is a cheetah faster than a horse?","Yes, it is the fastest land animal.","Yes, it is the fastest sandwich.","Cheetah is a faster horse yes."],["Why are you walking so slowly?","Because my bag is heavier today.","Because my bag is a bird today.","Slowly is walking me why."],["Who runs faster in your class?","Ali runs faster than everyone.","Ali runs faster than the moon cake.","Class is running faster."]],
