  c:[["What does a shepherd do?","He looks after the sheep.","He looks after the airport.","Shepherd is doing what."],["Why was the shepherd worried?","Because a wolf was near the sheep.","Because a cake was near the sheep.","Worried is shepherd why."],["What was his clever plan?","He made a fence of thorny branches.","He made a fence of chocolate.","Plan is clever his."],["Did the plan work?","Yes, the wolf never came back.","Yes, the wolf became a teacher.","Work is plan did."]],
  l:"A young shepherd looked after his family's sheep near the mountains. Every night, he counted them carefully. One evening, one little sheep was missing. He took his torch and went to look for it.",
