  r:"A clever shepherd had a problem. Every night, a hungry wolf came close to his sheep. He did not want to hurt the wolf, but he had to protect his animals. So he collected thorny branches and built a strong fence around the sheep. He also lit a small fire, because wolves are afraid of fire. When the wolf came, it saw the fire and could not get through the thorns. After a few nights, it gave up and went away to look for food in the mountains.",
